  "notes": "A whaleboat afloat at the wharf, 8.5 m long and 1.9 m in the beam, double-ended and white with dark gunwales: five thwarts with the oars tossed across them and their blades out over both sides, two tubs of line, the loggerhead aft and the long steering oar over the stern. Bow to local -Z. Base sea floats her at her marks as she stands.",
